ras/5fd6900b64c5d86852681ebc82ed49ae.mp4?t=1773342204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in tense combat</strong> with zombies, mutants, and rogue soldiers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a ruined world</strong>, from mountain hideouts to a crumbling city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge and craft</strong> to survive the harsh environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face powerful enemies</strong>, including terrifying bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience an emotional journey</strong> filled with danger, hope, and sacrifice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the truth and save humanity? The fight for survival begins now.</p>","developers":["DNZSOFT"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3404040/dfc29b1bd254df05c859f62993c71183482ac81e/header.jpg?t=1773342204","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 DNZSOFT. All rights reserved.<br />\r\n\"Heirs of Heaven\" and associated logos are trademarks of DNZSOFT.<br />\r\nUnreal\u00ae is a trademark or registered trademark of Epic Games, Inc. in the United States and elsewhere.<br />\r\nAll other trademarks and trade names are the property of their respective owners.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUnauthorized copying, distribution, or reverse engineering of this product is strictly prohibited.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor full terms and conditions, please refer to the End User License Agreement (EULA).","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>",